abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study in which elastic-net models are trained in adults to
  predict vertex-wise task activation in the dorsolateral prefrontal cortex from
  tractography-derived structural connectivity, and the adult models are then
  applied unchanged to neonatal connectivity from the Developing Human
  Connectome Project.
keywords:
  - dorsolateral prefrontal cortex
  - structural connectivity
  - tractography
  - neonatal neuroimaging
  - Human Connectome Project
  - Developing Human Connectome Project
license: MIT
